{"version":1,"content":"<html><body><img alt=\"\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://pro-img-cdn.tvb.com/uploads/image/2026/11/2026Skux27F8Ov1795577489.jpg?x-oss-process=image/resize,w_1200\"/><p>海關針對一個大型私煙及洗黑錢集團的執法行動進行簡報會，表示這次行動中，共檢獲約3200萬隻懷疑未完稅香煙，估計市值約一億四千萬元。經過深入嘅財富調查，海關也發現集團涉嫌在2025年9月至2026年1月期間，透過集團控制的戶口，處理約930萬元懷疑犯罪得益。行動中共拘捕5人，分別是集團主腦，集團旗下貿易公司董事和員工，以及一間物流運輸公司的兩名東主。</p></body></html>","scraped_at":"2026-11-25T07:03:59.481759+00:00","quality":{"score":1,"chars":175,"images":1,"source":"TVB 新聞","fallback":"none","origin":"article-html","completeness":"extracted"},"published_at":"2026-11-25T03:23:00+00:00","fetched_at":"2026-11-26T06:15:11.818997+00:00","content_updated_at":"2026-11-25T06:57:17.741817+00:00","content_hash":"4324d2157e9ea787fafa2ee11f86bc27e7da3db543e7581d0e7b151a3f059572","evidence_status":"full","scrape_error":null,"content_retention":{"scraped_at":"2026-11-25T07:03:59.481759+00:00","latest_fallback":"rss-budget","latest_error":null},"content_capture":null}